flowchart TD
    Start([Start Appointment Booking]) --> SelectDept[Select Department & Doctor]
    SelectDept --> FetchSlots[Fetch Available Consultation Slots]
    FetchSlots --> SelectSlot[Select Desired Slot & Date]
    SelectSlot --> CheckSlot{Slot Open?}
    CheckSlot -- No --> SlotConflict[Display Slot Conflict Alert] --> FetchSlots
    CheckSlot -- Yes --> CreateAppt[Create Appointment Record Status=Confirmed]
    CreateAppt --> SendNotification[Dispatch SMS / Email Notification]
    SendNotification --> IssueTicket[Issue Appointment Confirmation Slip]
    IssueTicket --> End([End Booking])
